    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process, start by receiving the invoice."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "Next, check the invoice for any mismatches."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If there is a need to \"re-send the invoice to the customer\", then proceed with continuing the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "If the option is to \"post the invoice\", then also continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Alternatively, if the decision is to \"block the invoice\", then again continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "Once these steps are completed, park the invoice."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "After the invoice has been handled, the process comes to an end."
    }
